00:22:20,622 --> 00:22:29,028
But essentially, all this CTA.json does is it gives the generator of these routes additional configuration options that allows it to do that.

218
00:22:29,486 --> 00:22:32,900
And so we really don't have to worry about this or configure any additional options.

219
00:22:33,774 --> 00:22:41,444
And then finally, we have a public folder, which is where we can keep any static assets that will be deployed with the app, including any images

