00:26:12,206 --> 00:26:20,048
And so this is what's essentially going to set up our React application by rendering the root.jsx here, which is the router provider.

259
00:26:20,366 --> 00:26:28,448
And so this router provider is coming from TanStack React router, and it's going to then provide it that router instance that we created up here,

