00:29:00,896 --> 00:29:03,296
where this route will be rendered under.

288
00:29:03,630 --> 00:29:11,812
So here, since we're passing a slash, this represents the root of the web app or the home page. And so that's where we're going to render this app.

289
00:29:12,366 --> 00:29:18,256
And then now with inside of create file route, we specify simply the component that we're going to render on this page.

